  "translation": "And the man said to Joab, “Even had I been weighing on my two palms a thousand silver, I would not stretch out my hand against the son of the king, for in our hearing the king commanded ⟨את⟩ you and ⟨את⟩ Abishai and ⟨את⟩ Ittai, saying, ‘Watch whoever is with the young man, with Absalom.’”",
